# A test fixture, and the only submodule in this repository.
#
# tests/fixtures/submodule-consumer exists so the `submodules` input on ci.yml
# can be proven rather than asserted: the self-test checks this tree out both
# with the input and without it, and fails if the file is present in the second
# case. Nothing here is used at runtime by any workflow this library ships.
#
# It is deliberately NOT related to vendor/script-helpers, which is a committed
# copy of the same upstream pinned by vendor/.script-helpers-ref and synced by
# scripts/sync_script_helpers.sh. Two pins to one project would otherwise look
# like a mistake, or get "fixed" into agreement. This one is pinned to a commit
# and only needs to move if the fixture stops checking out.
[submodule "tests/fixtures/submodule-consumer/shared/script-helpers"]
	path = tests/fixtures/submodule-consumer/shared/script-helpers
	url = https://github.com/nikolareljin/script-helpers.git
